        "correct": false,
        "why": "`loc` never counts positions."
      },
      {
        "text": "`loc` asks for the 22nd of March as a position; `iloc` as a label",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "The other way round."
      },
      {
        "text": "`loc` the label, `iloc` the 81st position",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right; here they happen to coincide."
      },
      {
        "text": "`iloc` is the faster version of `loc`",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "They answer different questions."
      }
    ]
